ction cap. Technical iterator limits are declared and counted if reached, not assumed mathematical exhaustion. Exact no-op cache is keyed by signature and PRE-contraction scope domains; every useful closure restarts proposals. Expert preserves51 ordered Sudoku-specific detectors and larger historical limits, a separate domain-specific reference. Only original-core contractions prune; no DFS, probes or assumptions. Plain MAC only runs ordinary GAC. A separate unmeasured phase can finish each saved closed prefix with identical plain MAC to count remaining DFS nodes, including the root."}
